+witness report, plate note,1-A diagram and actual time card; original negatives,
+contact sheets and ownership mappings; NK2405 and source helicopter recordings;
+ATC CD-ROM/viewer/tracks and visibility explanation; K1966 tape, calibrated
+camera clock and van comparison; CART job/image hashes and substantive results;
+sample/control submissions and final chemistry; administrative disposition;
+three released-form ARMS assets and asset-level search/withdrawal descriptions.
+No proposed retrieval or discriminating experiment is represented as completed.
+
+An initial publication-check run stopped at the README link to its not-yet-written
